# Pairs with OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision. A participant that lost its cache
# rebuilds under system origin instead of as the ambient caller.
MODULE: PeerRestoreDecidedWithoutShadow
TARGET: OwnSagaCommitNeedsDurableDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a decided own-saga commit borrows the prepare's authority without the shadow this participant built
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
ELSE IF cache # NoShadow THEN "decided"
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF TRUE THEN "decided"
--- END
